      "s": "Bloomberg Tech",
      "t": "Musk Says Every US Kid to Get Two SpaceX Shares, Doubling Pledge",
      "d": "Elon Musk and SpaceX will give every child in the US two shares in the space exploration company, doubling a commitment the world’s richest person made just last month.",
      "u": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/musk-says-every-us-kid-to-get-two-spacex-shares-doubling-pledge",
      "m": "11. 26. AM 04:52",
      "ts": 1795668774000,
      "fullText": "Technology Musk Says Every US Kid to Get Two SpaceX Shares, Doubling Pledge Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift Gift this article Contact us: Provide news feedback or report an error Confidential tip? Send a tip to our reporters Site feedback: Take our Survey New Window Facebook X LinkedIn Email Link Gift By Peter Vercoe November 26, 2026 at 4:52 AM UTC Bookmark Save Elon Musk and SpaceX will give every child in the US two shares in the space exploration company, doubling a commitment the world’s richest person made just last month. SpaceX will contribute one newly issued share of its Class A common stock to every currently active Trump Account, the company said in a statement Wednesday. As part of his pledge to donate one SpaceX share to every kid in America, Musk will personally match the number of shares donated by SpaceX."
